    "text_1638515972": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "hideComponent": "false",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 15 2024 18:56:07 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2>Every year, the DE&amp;I Summit demonstrates the power of sharing stories</h2>\n<p>From the beginning of the event, employees were deeply moved by powerful stories from fellow colleagues. We learned why DE&amp;I matters to each person, the value of inclusive language and the critical role of allyship in fostering a culture of inclusion and belonging. Many employees stood on stage and shared their “why” with courage and vulnerability, while others added their reasons to the “What’s your why?” wall. “For me, I added ‘unlock potential’ to the wall because creating a culture where everyone can thrive enables innovation and growth,” said Annie Heath, Vice President, Diversity Equity and Inclusion. “When you feel like you belong, you have the ability to reach your potential.”</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 15 2024 19:16:03 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "bottomMargin": "3",
      "cq:responsive": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "default": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "offset": "2",
          "width": "8"
