    "text_1866589790": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "hideComponent": "false",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Aug 15 2024 18:58:38 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2>Stryker employees dedicate time to give back</h2>\n<p>Employee resource group (ERG) members partnered with Stryker’s Global Volunteer Network to organize a volunteer activity to support the American <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/news/2023/features/how-stryker-supports-the-red-cross-lifesaving-mission.html\">Red Cross</a>. Together, employees assembled disaster relief kits for people affected by disasters like floods, hurricanes, and countless other crises. The Red Cross is one of our key nonprofit partners, and efforts like these help us further our commitment to creating a healthier and more equitable world.<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 21 2024 15:14:07 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "bottomMargin": "3",
